codex
I found a native-copy regression: an input whose visible label and `aria-label` are both “Send” fails against an approved “Send” copy slot because the matcher compares it with “Send Send.” The backstop also skips direct text in `display: contents` wrappers and rejects text reachable through inner scroll regions. I’m checking these paths in memory; I haven’t run the browser harness because it creates files.
